#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:162
msgid "File(s) to watermark"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:163
msgid ""
"List file name(s) of PDF(s) to watermark, one per line, e.g., <code>upload.pdf</"
"code> or <code>my_pdf.pdf</code> .<br>If left blank, Watermark PDF for WooCommerce "
"will watermark all PDFs sold through WooCommerce."
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:171
msgid "Right to Left Watermarking"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:172
msgid ""
"Check to switch from default left-to-right (LTR) to right-to-left (RTL), for "
"Arabic, Hebrew, etc."
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:179
msgid "Start Page"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:180
msgid ""
"Provide a number to indicate the page you wish watermarking to begin on. Defaults "
"to page 1."
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:192
msgid "End Page"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:193
msgid ""
"Provide a number to indicate the page you wish watermarking to end on. Defaults to "
"last page. Use -1 to indicate last page."
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:205
msgid "Pages to watermark"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:206
msgid ""
"Watermark every page, the first page only, the last page only, every odd page, or "
"every even page."
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:221
msgid "Custom text for footer watermark"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:222
msgid ""
"Shortcodes available, all caps, in brackets: <code>[FIRSTNAME]</code> "
"<code>[LASTNAME]</code> <code>[EMAIL]</code> <code>[PHONE]</code> <code>[DATE]</"
"code>"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:223
msgid "Licensed to [FIRSTNAME] [LASTNAME], [EMAIL]"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:231
msgid "Font face"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:232
msgid ""
"Select a font for watermarks. M Sung will have limited Chinese characters, and "
"Furat will have limited Arabic characters"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:250
msgid "Top/bottom margin"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:251
msgid "In millimeters. Yes, metric! Defaults to 10mm"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:263
msgid "Left/right margin"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:264
msgid "In millimeters. Defaults to 10mm"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:277
msgid "Font size"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:278
msgid "Provide a number (suggested 10-20) for the footer watermark font size"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:291
msgid "Watermark color"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:292
msgid "Color of the footer watermark. Default is black: <code>#000000</code>."
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:299
msgid "X Fine Tuning"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:300
msgid ""
"Move the footer watermark left and right on the page by adjusting this number. "
"Default 15mm (left of portrait 8.5x11\" page)."
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:313
msgid "Y Fine Tuning"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:314
msgid ""
"In millimeters. Move the footer watermark up and down on the page by adjusting this "
"number. If this number is longer/higher than the length/height of your PDF, it will "
"default back to -10 (10 millimeters from the bottom of the page). Account for the "
"height of your font/text!"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:326
msgid "Leave No Trace?"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:327
msgid ""
"If this box is checked if/when you uninstall WaterMark PDF, all your settings will "
"be deleted from your Wordpress database."
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:337
msgid "WaterWoo Security Options"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:338
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The following security settings are not included in the free version of this "
"plugin; <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">upgrade for access</a>"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:343
msgid "Serve PDF if not watermarked?"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:344
msgid ""
"Should the unwatermarked PDF still be served if watermarking or encryption fails?"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:355
msgid "Encryption Level"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:356
msgid ""
"Choose encryption key length. Encryption is required for passwording and file "
"protections, but can slow down and possibly stall your downloads, especially if you "
"are watermarking files with images or embedded fonts. Note the RC4 stream cipher is "
"not bullet-proof."
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:370
msgid "Disable Low Res Printing"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:371
msgid ""
"Check this box to make it much more difficult for your PDF to be printed at all by "
"the end consumer."
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:378
msgid "Disable Copying"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:379
msgid ""
"Check this box to prevent your end consumer from copying and pasting content from "
"your PDF."
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:386
msgid "Disable Editing"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:387
msgid ""
"Check this box to prevent editing/modification of your PDF by the end consumer in "
"Acrobat."
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:394
msgid "Disable Annotations"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:395
msgid ""
"Check this box to prevent the addition or modification of text annotations/"
"comments, and filling of interactive form fields. If \"editing and annotation\" are "
"both allowed, customers can create or modify interactive form fields (including "
"signature fields)."
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:402
msgid "Disable Assembly"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:403
msgid ""
"Check this box to prevent insertion, rotation, or deletion of pages and creation of "
"bookmarks or thumbnail images."
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:410
msgid "Disable High Res Printing"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:411
msgid ""
"Check this box to make it much more difficult for your PDF to be printed "
"beautifully by the end consumer."
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:418
msgid "Disable Form Filling"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:419
msgid ""
"Check this box to prevent filling in existing interactive form fields (including "
"signature fields)."
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:426
msgid "Disable Accessibility"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:427
msgid ""
"Check this box to prevent extraction of text and graphics (in support of "
"accessibility to users with disabilities or for other purposes). Some PDF readers "
"already disable this."
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:434
msgid "User Password (optional)"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:435
msgid ""
"This is a password your end user will need to enter *before viewing* the PDF file. "
"Enter <code>email</code> to set the password automagically as the user's checkout "
"email address."
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:443
msgid "Owner Password (optional)"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:444
msgid ""
"An owner password allows the end user to take control of a PDF. Leave blank and it "
"will be set by MD5 hash automatically (it will be different for every download, and "
"you will not know it). Enter <code>email</code> to set the password automagically "
"as the user's checkout email address."
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:452
msgid "Unlock with User Password?"
msgstr ""

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:453
msgid ""
"By default PDF protections can only be removed with an owner password. Check to "
"allow removal with a user password. USE WITH CAUTION."
msgstr ""

